    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "3 Bedroom Houses at Ard Valley\r\n\r\nThe 3 bedroom houses at Ard Valley offers a range of contemporary homes situated in this highly desirable setting within easy reach of Cabinteely village. These brand-new, A-rated homes range in size from approximately 104 to 120 sq m and are available in a selection of mid-terrace, end-terrace, and semi-detached designs, providing flexibility to suit a variety of lifestyles.\r\n\r\nDesigned with modern living in mind, each home prioritises light, space, and energy efficiency, delivering comfortable interiors alongside reduced running costs. The development enjoys excellent transport connectivity, allowing for easy access to Dublin city centre and surrounding areas while retaining a peaceful residential atmosphere.\r\n\r\nArd Valley benefits from close proximity to excellent schools, shops, cafés, and a range of local services, with Cabinteely Park also nearby offering attractive green spaces and recreational amenities. Combining quality design, a convenient location, and a welcoming neighbourhood, Ard Valley provide an ideal place to call home.\r\n\r\nFor more information, please contact Savills New Homes on (01) 618 1300."
      },
